---

**My top recommendation for minimalism**: **#4 Pure Monochrome** or **#2 Slate + Emerald**

These are the most minimal and timeless. Pure monochrome is extremely clean and lets your content shine, while Slate + Emerald adds just enough color to keep it interesting without being overwhelming.

To apply any of these, you would replace the color values in lines 4-26 of your `src/styles.css` file. Would you like me to show you exactly how to implement one of these themes?# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

